          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A crunchy, colorful bowl built around king salmon, gently poached with lemon, bay leaf and salt so it stays buttery and rich.</p><p>Serve the salmon warm over the salad, or chill it and flake it on top for a cold lunch that packs well.</p>",
