        "m_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Poach once, eat all week",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Poach the salmon up to 2 days ahead and refrigerate it whole, then flake it just before serving. Chop the vegetables and keep the dressing in its own jar, so the greens stay crisp for lunches on the go.</p><p>Thaw the fillets in the fridge overnight, and pat them dry before they go into the pan.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
